OL,3,GNEWSATraffic filters scheme replaces
OL,4,Acongestion charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxford's temporary congestion charge
OL,7,Fhas come to end, but has simultaneously
OL,8,Fbeen replaced with a new traffic
OL,9,Ffilters trial.
OL,11,FThe filters were first approved by
OL,12,FOxfordshire County Council in November
OL,13,F2022, but their start date was
OL,14,Frepeatedly delayed by the closure of
OL,15,Fthe Botley Road.
OL,17,FIn the meantime, the council introduced
OL,18,Fthe temporary congestion charge, which
OL,19,Fsaw motorists charged #5 per day for
OL,20,Ftravelling through points on six roads
OL,21,Fin the city.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
