OL,3,GNEWSATraffic filters scheme replaces
OL,4,Acongestion charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut with the Botley Road now reopen,
OL,7,Ffrom 07:00 Monday morning car drivers
OL,8,Fwill face a fine of up to #70 for
OL,9,Fpassing through the same six charge
OL,10,Fpoints as the previous congestion
OL,11,Fcharge.
